OL,3,GNEWSARSPB reports record-breaking
OL,4,Achough numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record-breaking number of choughs
OL,7,Fhave made their nests around the
OL,8,FCornish coastline this summer, proving
OL,9,Fthe breed is in "robust health", a bird
OL,10,Fconservation charity has said.
OL,12,FRSPB England said 161 choughs had been
OL,13,Fcounted in Cornwall - 32 more than the
OL,14,F129 recorded in 2025.
OL,16,FThe charity said the new birds came
OL,17,Ffrom 56 successful breeding pairs,
OL,18,Fmeaning the average productivity of a
OL,19,FCornish chough nest was three
OL,20,Ffledglings.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
