OL,3,GNEWSARSPB reports record-breaking
OL,4,Achough numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said choughs died out in Cornwall in
OL,7,Fthe 1970s but returned in 2001 when
OL,8,Fthree birds believed to be from Ireland
OL,9,Flanded at Lizard Point and began
OL,10,Frebreeding. The National Trust added
OL,11,Fthe success had been down to
OL,12,Fcooperation between agencies, farmers
OL,13,Fand landowners.
